      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "-: In the last lecture we had a look at the basic NGF syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "and that's the syntax you're going to use most of the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.73,
          "en": "There is one alternative to it though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 14.94,
          "en": "Sometimes you have not only the \"if condition\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.94,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "but also a \"else condition\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "So here we might want to say server was created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.68,
          "en": "server name is something with NGF.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 24.69,
          "en": "But we could also add a else block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.69,
          "end": 27.69,
          "en": "where we then want to say no server was created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "Now we deleted that exact text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 31.77,
          "en": "for the reason that we don't want to see it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.77,
          "end": 34.65,
          "en": "but imagine that we do want to show that alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.65,
          "end": 39.03,
          "en": "So no server was created, could be the text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.03,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "and now we want to show this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 44.82,
          "en": "only if NGF is not true or t his condition server created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.82,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "is not true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 50.88,
          "en": "We can achieve this by placing a local reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.88,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "on this element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "And local reference is something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.81,
          "end": 58.86,
          "en": "I will dive deeper into in the understanding components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.86,
          "end": 59.85,
          "en": "and data binding section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "This course, for now, let's think of it as a marker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 67.397,
          "en": "So I will name this, no server, any name you like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.397,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "Let's name this no Server with a capital S.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 75.59,
          "en": "And now we need to change the paragraph here to NG template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "That is a component, a directive shipping, with Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 84.57,
          "en": "which you can use to mark places in the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.57,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "And now I will add the paragraph back in this template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 90.24,
          "en": "with the text in between like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 92.55,
          "en": "So now basically the text you want to output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.55,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "And now with NG template with the local references marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "on it, we mark a certain spot in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 102.42,
          "en": "which we want to show conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 106.32,
          "en": "Now to show it conditionally, we simply enhance NGF",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 110.25,
          "en": "by also adding else and then no server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.25,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "So this marker replaced on NG template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "And that's all the syntax we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "If we save this, you see no server was created, and, as soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.88,
          "en": "as I click here, that gets replaced with server was created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.88,
          "end": 126.51,
          "en": "So that is NGF else, a nice little addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.51,
          "end": 130.08,
          "en": "in a use case where you have, well, an else condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.08,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "Of course, the alternative would always be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 135.81,
          "en": "to simply use NGF with the reversed check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.81,
          "end": 138.6,
          "en": "so if exclamation mark server created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.6,
          "end": 141.69,
          "en": "But that here is another nice alternative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.69,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "Now I'm going to delete it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "You will find an article after the section here though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "where you can find this code again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.36,
          "en": "in case you're interested.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 152.01,
          "en": "And we will also use this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 155.07,
          "en": "in the course project we're going to build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.07,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "I just wanted to highlight that this option exists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.17000000000002,
          "en": "Using NGF like this, however,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
